 "lines": [
  {
   "start": 0.5,
   "end": 4.825,
   "text": "The apostles came back and told Jesus everything they had done.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 5.225,
   "end": 8.696,
   "text": "Come away with me to a quiet place, and rest a while.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 9.096,
   "end": 14.01,
   "text": "But the crowds saw them leaving, and ran ahead on foot. Five thousand men.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 14.41,
   "end": 19.139,
   "text": "When Jesus saw them, he had compassion. They were like sheep without a shepherd.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 19.639,
   "end": 21.768,
   "text": "It's late. Send them away to buy food.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 22.168,
   "end": 23.929,
   "text": "You give them something to eat.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 24.329,
   "end": 26.42,
   "text": "We only have five loaves, and two fish.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 26.92,
   "end": 30.555,
   "text": "He looked up to heaven, gave thanks, and broke the bread.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 31.155,
   "end": 36.355,
   "text": "And it kept going. Everyone ate, and was full. Twelve baskets were left over.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 37.055,
   "end": 42.057,
   "text": "That night, he sent the disciples ahead in the boat, and went up the mountain to pray.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 42.557,
   "end": 45.781,
   "text": "The wind was against them. They rowed for hours.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 46.181,
   "end": 50.59,
   "text": "Before dawn, they saw someone walking toward them, on the water.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 50.89,
   "end": 51.74,
   "text": "It's a ghost!",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 52.14,
   "end": 55.158,
   "text": "Take courage. It is I. Don't be afraid.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 55.758,
   "end": 60.655,
   "text": "He climbed into the boat, and the wind stopped. They were completely amazed.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 61.555,
   "end": 65.164,
   "text": "Follow for part eleven.",
   "tempter": false
  }
 ]
}